\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-303303 ttt.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/93/Spine_static-303303_ttt.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"242\" height=\"486\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"242\" data-file-height=\"486\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3033\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTT\" title=\"TTT\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTT\" title=\"TTT\"><img alt=\"TTT\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-303301.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-303301.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/96/HeadIconSmall-303301.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTT\" title=\"TTT\">TTT</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.1</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>沿着77号公路</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：303303</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">TTT正在思考，究竟是什么导致人们见到她就跑呢？<br />她并不认为自己相貌可怕，那么一定是其他原因导致的惊吓。为什么那些恐怖电影都喜欢用电视机做素材？<br />也许有什么形象可以理所当然地出现在屏幕中，向另一侧的人搭话，又不会引起警戒和恐慌？<br />天气预报员？电视购物节目的主持人？或者假装自己是一位超级黑客？<br />正当她沿着电线思考时，汽车餐厅的视频通讯点餐系统吸引了她的注意。<br />“就是这个！汽车餐厅的服务员！好客的可爱粉色、穿梭停车场的旱冰鞋、奢华的甜品，还有永远留在玻璃另一侧的待客之道！”……<br />“来一份巨无霸。”<br />“一份特大奶昔。”<br />“来一份巨无霸，不要加美乃滋。”<br />好吧，至少对方不会看到她就跑了。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"303303\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303304.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fc/Belonging-303304.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">草莓冰淇淋模型<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Strawberry Sundae Model</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />4<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>拍摄广告时使用的模型道具，仅供观赏参考，并不能食用。拍摄结束后作为纪念品被赠予了TTT。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303305.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/98/Belonging-303305.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">标准服务生制服<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Waitress Uniform</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>某著名连锁汽车餐厅的员工制服。TTT注意到打扮成这样出现在屏幕中时，人们会更乐意与她交谈，哪怕对话的开端总是“来一份巨无霸”。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303306.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e2/Belonging-303306.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">汽车影院服务生\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">轮滑鞋</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Drive-in Theater Roller Skates</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>某著名汽车餐厅品牌旗下影院的标配，方便员工在偌大的停车场中穿梭送餐。<br />TTT用不到这双鞋，而服装的意义并不只有实用性。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A7%801.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 周六特别秀1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A7%801.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A7%801.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A7%801.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E7%A7%801.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.hu